{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-27T12:08:56.144Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"204abaf84e89262155a1e246","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-qz1k"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Typed parameter binding manifests: declare preset parameters once, resolve across settings, templates and seeds"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"From the 2026-10-21 fleet backlog audit item 2. Declare required preset parameters once in a typed manifest and resolve them consistently through settings, templates and seeds, returning unanswered choices before installation. Acceptance: (1) one supplied project parameter reaches every declared occurrence; (2) unknown/missing bindings refuse before any write; (3) secret values cannot enter generated public seed prose. Deliver typed SDK surface + CLI flags, compact TOON/JSON output, typed refusals with remedies, docs, property tests and real-data validation on a read-only copy of a public fleet tracker in a non-git temp dir."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["authoring","bindings","parameters","presets","sdk"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-27T12:08:56.144Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-27T12:08:56.144Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"pi-agent"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"da75bc2e136fb5ba8e723ae683f839cf9c129c20ba66210b0dcf1129cfbe7783","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","event_class":"subs